        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. </p><p>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.<br/></p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer is suitable for all skin types, including sensitive skin.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dnfwT7": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer fragrance-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer is formulated without fragrance.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_JdcF6z": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is the difference between a gel-cream and a moisturizer?",
            "content": "<p>Cloud Dew Gel Cream Moisturizer  is instantly hydrating, lightweight formula is a modern take to a traditional moisturizer.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wNAx9A": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long will it take to notice a difference?",
            "content": "<p>Your skin will instantly feel hydrated upon application.<br/>Using Cloud Dew™ Gel Cream Moisturizer daily will help improve your skin to feel smoother and more hydrated. </p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wWyCFG": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use this product on other parts of my body?",
            "content": "<p>Yes!  We recommend using Cloud Dew™ Gel Cream Moisturizer on your face and working product down your neck and chest.</p>",
